<h1 class="page-title">Social Media Production</h1>
<p class="standfirst">Social media content and strategy for artists.</p>

{#- Wes Coeur, as a case study: the brief, the strategy, the results (the
    headline numbers) and two of the videos. #}
<h2>Wes Coeur</h2>
<p class="standfirst">Instagram &amp; TikTok &middot; 2026&ndash;</p>

<h3>The brief</h3>
<p>I help Melbourne artist <a href="https://open.spotify.com/artist/4zjTgLNIPksuxMXCKClne9">Wes Coeur</a> produce his social media content and plan the strategy behind it, to grow an audience for his music.</p>

<h3>The strategy</h3>
<p>Let Wes be himself. His videos are about the things he genuinely cares about, so the audience they find shares his interests, and they're the people most likely to love his music: R&amp;B, soul and electro-pop that owes as much to Prince's romance as to The Weeknd's moody glamour. (Wes and I also frequently collaborate musically together: see <a href="/interests/music/">Music</a>.)</p>

<h3>The results</h3>
<ul class="stats">
  <li><span class="stats__n">3+ million</span> views across various platforms</li>
  <li><span class="stats__n">500 <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span><span class="visually-hidden">to</span> 5,000</span> Instagram followers</li>
  <li><span class="stats__n">0 <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span><span class="visually-hidden">to</span> 3,400</span> TikTok followers</li>
</ul>

