<h2>Sounds Of</h2>
<p>My live-music series, <a href="/sounds-of/">Sounds Of</a>, wasn't set up to build a big following, but I still gave it a consistent brand, and posted weekly clips and highlights from the series to TikTok, Instagram and YouTube Shorts, scheduling each week's posts ahead in Meta Business Suite and keeping an eye on how they performed.</p>
<ul class="stats">
  <li><span class="stats__n">86,631</span> views on YouTube</li>
</ul>
<ul>
  <li><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@soundsofchannel">YouTube</a> &ndash; Sounds Of</li>
  <li><a href="https://www.instagram.com/soundsof.aus/">Instagram</a> &ndash; @soundsof.aus</li>
  <li><a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@soundsof.aus">TikTok</a> &ndash; @soundsof.aus</li>
</ul>

<h2>What I do</h2>
<ul class="points">
  <li>Strategy: working out who'll love an artist's music, and what will reach them</li>
  <li>Producing short-form video for TikTok, Instagram Reels and YouTube Shorts</li>
  <li>A consistent look and voice across every platform</li>
  <li>Scheduling each week's posts ahead in Meta Business Suite, and learning from how they perform</li>
</ul>
